{"about_the_game":"Guardi\u00e3o Tup\u00e3 is a fantasy adventure set in a world where the creatures of the Brazilian folk are being threatened by the dreaded Dry Body, which seeks to break the balance and invade other worlds. On this journey, you take control of a newly created being using part of the energies of an ancient guardian. This being sets out to recover its strength and restore the balance, also learning more about this world and Brazilian culture in the process.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore a fantastic world</strong><br><br>An entity is threatening the kingdom and only the remnants of the old guardian can reverse the situation! Fight corruption and restore balance to the forest.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846970/extras/Cenario.gif?t=1719458994\" /><br><br><br></li><li><strong>Use your amber hook</strong><br><br>Your amber hook can do much more than just destroy, traverse great distances, and combine your skills to forge a brighter future.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846970/extras/Hook.gif?t=1719458994\" /><br><br><br></li><li><strong>Discover a world of folklore and fantasy inspired by Brazilian culture</strong><br><br>Face the dreaded Dry Body, restore balance and save various endangered entities.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846970/extras/Combate.gif?t=1719458994\" /><br></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846970?t=1719458994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1719458994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1719458994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com